{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Ultra Maze Demo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrilling maze adventure in a compact version! The demo features a constantly changing maze that adjusts its size after each round \u2014 keeping every challenge fresh and surprising.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic maze sizes:</strong> After each round, the maze automatically grows or shrinks \u2014 perfect variety for quick sessions!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited configuration:</strong> The full version\u2019s extensive customization options aren\u2019t available here \u2014 but you can jump right in and enjoy the excitement.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced fun:</strong> Ideal to get a taste of Ultra Maze and gear up for the full experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to dive in?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into procedurally generated mazes, find your way through shifting challenges, and feel the gripping atmosphere of Ultra Maze \u2014 now in the demo!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797030?t=1758099320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797030/1ff3283de379ec1e645aed8d295019c37d50d4e5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758099320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797030/c7568c8012e740e4cc004b3f2aa91ae652cdafd9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758099320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797030/c7568c8012e740e4cc004b3f2aa91ae652cdafd9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758099320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":